{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ca-cms-2025-sriram-ias",
    "name": "Sriram IAS - Current Affairs CMS",
    "description": "# Current Affairs Management — Admin CMS\n\nBase path: `{{baseUrl}}/api/current-affairs`\n\n## Quick setup\n\n1. Import **CURRENT_AFFAIRS_POSTMAN_ENVIRONMENT.json** (or Production variant).\n2. Select environment: **Sriram IAS - Current Affairs (Local)**.\n3. Set `superAdminEmail` / `superAdminPassword` to match your `.env` (`SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL`, `SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD`).\n4. Run **0. Setup → Health Check**.\n5. Run **1. Auth → Login Super Admin** — saves `authToken` automatically.\n6. For file uploads, pick a PDF in the **pdf** form-data field on create/update requests.\n7. Run create requests — `currentAffairId` is saved for Get / Update / Delete / Status.\n\n## Categories\n\n| UI | API value |\n|----|-----------|\n| Current Affairs | CURRENT_AFFAIRS |\n| Monthly Magazine | MONTHLY_MAGAZINE |\n| Infographics | INFOGRAPHICS |\n| Monthly Recap | MONTHLY_RECAP |\n| Daily Practice Questions | DAILY_PRACTICE_QUESTIONS |\n\n## Field rules\n\n| Category | Fields |\n|----------|--------|\n| CURRENT_AFFAIRS | title + pdf only (no year/month) |\n| MONTHLY_MAGAZINE | title + year + month + pdf |\n| INFOGRAPHICS / MONTHLY_RECAP | title + year + month + pdf |\n| DAILY_PRACTICE_QUESTIONS | Use **DAILY_PRACTICE_QUESTIONS_POSTMAN_COLLECTION.json** → POST `/daily-practice` |\n\nPDF required for all PDF categories. Max 10 MB. Field name: `pdf`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{authToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.get('baseUrl') && pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl')) {",
          "  pm.environment.set('baseUrl', pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl'));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000" },
    { "key": "authToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "currentAffairId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "description": "Verify server is running before testing Current Affairs APIs."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('API is OK', function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('OK');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"OK\",\n  \"message\": \"Sriram IAS Backend is running\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-06-01T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Swagger Docs (browser)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api-docs",
            "description": "Open in Postman or browser for interactive API docs."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Super Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{superAdminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{superAdminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login-super-admin",
            "description": "Uses credentials from `.env`: SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL / SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD.\n\nSaves token to `authToken`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login successful', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.environment.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@sriram.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login-super-admin"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"665900000000000000000001\",\n    \"name\": \"Super Admin\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@sriram.com\",\n    \"role\": \"super_admin\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Center Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{centerAdminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{centerAdminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Legacy center admin login. Set centerAdminEmail / centerAdminPassword in environment."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Admin Access",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"officialEmail\": \"{{adminAccessEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminAccessPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login-admin-access",
            "description": "Dynamic admin user login. If response has requiresOtp=true, run Verify Admin Access OTP next."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (json.adminAccessId) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('adminAccessId', json.adminAccessId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Admin Access OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"adminAccessId\": \"{{adminAccessId}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{adminAccessOtp}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login-admin-access/verify-otp"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
